mlxflow 0.8; offdevice
1. Read Index           library.index
2. Embed                BGE-M3; "Summarize our indemnification obligations"
3. Retrieve     (1,2)   top_k=5
4. Template             "Context:\n{input}\n\nQ: Summarize our
                        indemnification obligations"
5. Answer               Qwen3 8B
6. Gate         (5,3)   Ministral 3B; "Complete and grounded, ready to
                        ship? tags: ship, escalate"
   -> { ship: 7 | escalate: 8 }
7. Template     (5)     "{1}"
   -> 9

8. Answer       (4)     claude-sonnet @ anthropic; "cite sources"    remote
9. Save Text            answer.md

models:
  claude-sonnet @ anthropic = anthropic/claude-sonnet-4
